2026-09-03 03:32:06,053 [INFO]          (scratchpad/wfhtest/repro3.py): FileHandler -> on-disk log holds ONLY
2026-09-03 03:32:06,053 [INFO]          the boot banner (inode swapped mid-run); WatchedFileHandler -> all
2026-09-03 03:32:06,053 [INFO]          lines through EOD survive the identical swap. Control that confirms
